# Random modules of type classes, with superclasses, and instances for types of
# every representation, lists, with a constraint, and boxes, with or without one,
# whose polymorphic predicates call methods and each other and print what they
# give (see utils/codegen-oracle/generate-class-programs.py): merkc's programs,
# at -O0 and -O2, and with heap chunks of 64 bytes, print what mmc's print. The
# seed is fixed, so the modules are too; to search further, run
# generate-class-programs.py with other seeds.
#
# REQUIRES: mmc
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %python %S/../../../utils/codegen-oracle/generate-class-programs.py --seed 1 --count 15 %t
# RUN: %compare-runs --levels 0 2 --chunk-bytes 64 --jobs 4 %t/*.m
